==English==
{{wikipedia}}
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ru|en}} {{term|Коминтерн|tr=Komintérn|lang=ru}}, contracted abbreviation of  {{term|[[коммунистический|Коммунисти́ческий]] [[Интернациона́л]]||tr=Kommunístíčeskij Intɛrnacionál|Communist International|lang=ru}}, from {{term|коммунисти́ческий|lang=ru}} + {{term|Интернациона́л|tr=Intɛrnacionál|lang=ru}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈkɒmɪntəːn/|lang=en}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{context|now|_|historical|lang=en}} An [[international]] [[association]] of [[Communist]] [[parties]], established in 1919 by Vladimir Lenin and dissolved in 1943.

